                                                "example_id": "cc1a0d98-aa08-46c0-a4b7-2d14703b7209",
                                                "sense_id": "22eda375-a3a9-3517-aa07-e9d5b15f9f2c",
                                                "text": "And many of the Conſuls, rais'd and met,\n Are at the Dukes already."
                                            },
